{
  "slug": "kentucky-derby-marathon-2023",
  "title": "Run50 #第1州番外 肯塔基 德比马拉松 赛马城最大的跑步 Party",
  "page": "/run50/wechat-new/kentucky-derby-marathon-2023-modern-rail.html",
  "status": "pending",
  "entry_fix": false,
  "intro": "一场属于 Derby City 的跑步 Party： Churchill Downs 、 Big Four Bridge 、市中心、MaraFoto 路照，以及一群熟悉的路城朋友。",
  "map": "",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-zh-kentucky-derby-marathon-2023.jpg?v=20260704-ky23-user-pick",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "前言"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我来<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">路易斯维尔</strong>已经快<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">四年</span>了，<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">肯塔基</strong>的<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">德比</strong>马拉松我也跑过<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">三次</span>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>自从会跑步以后，我陆陆续续去过很多城市，也在这些城市里留过很多个miles和words。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>但我好像确实没怎么写过了<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">肯塔基</strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">德比</strong>马拉松，自己生活城市里的跑步party，不记录一下，有点说不过去。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "Run Derby City @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Run Derby City"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "赛马城，路易斯维尔🏇 Louisville, Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">路易斯维尔</strong>，挺陌生的名字，没来美国之前，我都没听说过。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我没听说过，不代表没有存在感。<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">路易斯维尔</strong>，得名于法国国王路易十六（Louis XVI），也被称为“<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">赛马</strong>之都”，以盛产波旁威士忌，棒球棍，拳王阿里，肯德基，中国女足球员王霜而出名。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>当然，王霜没我来的早，就算见到我，也得称我一声“前辈”。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "Racing Louisville @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Racing Louisville"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我的法国朋友Louise Le Barbenchon告诉我Louis的”s“不发音，所以这里应该叫”路易维尔“，如果你能<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">第一次</span>就说对这里的名字，一定会被本地人高看。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "Louisville @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Louisville"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "Louisville @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Louisville"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>每年的四月底五月初的时候，为了庆祝<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">肯塔基</strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">德比</strong>（<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">Kentucky</strong> <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">Derby</strong>）<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">赛马</strong>节，路城会举办一系列眼花缭乱的活动，比如<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">赛马</strong>前两周的\"<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">路易斯维尔</strong>空中烟花节\" （Thunder Over <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">Louisville</strong>）和 飞行表演（<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">Louisville</strong> Air Show）</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "Air Show @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Air Show"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "Air Show @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Air Show"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "Air show @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Air show"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这两个活动的绝佳观赏地是俄亥俄河滨，通常是下午飞行表演， 晚上烟花秀，我挺喜欢的，确实挺帅的，特别是F22飞过，脑袋都被振得嗡嗡响。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "Air Show Evening @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Air Show Evening"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "Air Show Evening @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Air Show Evening"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>活动的重头戏是夜晚的烟花表演。烟花配以音乐，营造出迷人的视听氛围。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "Thunder Over Loyisville @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Thunder Over Loyisville"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "Thunder Over Louisville @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Thunder Over Louisville"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>每年五月的第一个星期六，是美国最古老、也是最有名望的<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">赛马</strong>盛事：<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">肯塔基</strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">德比</strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">赛马</strong>节（<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">Kentucky</strong> <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">Derby</strong>）</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "Kentucky Derby @Google",
      "alt": "Kentucky Derby"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>首届<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">肯塔基</strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">德比</strong>于1875年5月17日在切彻福特<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">德比</strong>公园举行，吸引了大约1.2万名观众。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "Kentucky Derby @Google",
      "alt": "Kentucky Derby"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛当天，世界各地的观众聚集在丘吉尔唐斯<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">赛马</strong>场（<strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">Churchill</strong> Downs</strong>），观众们会穿着时髦的服装，女性戴上引人注目的帽子，成为一种传统和文化象征。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "Kentucky Derby @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Kentucky Derby"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "Kentucky Derby @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Kentucky Derby"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "Kentucky Derby @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Kentucky Derby"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">Derby</strong>的票价很贵，不过赛前一天的Oak母马比赛也同样精彩，还便宜一点，我和<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">47</span>也过去感受了一下。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "Kentucky Derby @Siqi",
      "alt": "Kentucky Derby"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "Kentucky Derby @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Kentucky Derby"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">肯塔基</strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">德比</strong>马拉松也是整个<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">德比</strong>季的一部分，夹在空中烟花节和<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">德比</strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">赛马</strong>节中间的周末，我的最爱，终于要登场了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "肯塔基德比马拉松🏇 Louisville, Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">肯塔基</strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">德比</strong>马拉松通常在四月的最后一个星期六举行。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这个比赛于1974年首次举办，已经是美国最受欢迎的马拉松比赛之一。今年就有超过15,000名跑者参加了比赛。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">Derby</strong>马的起点将位于<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">路易斯维尔</strong>棒球场附近（<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">Louisville</strong> Slugger Field），终点在王霜所在的<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">路易斯维尔</strong>竞技足球队（Racing <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">Louisville</strong>）的主场林恩体育场（Lynn Family Stadium）</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "Kentucky Derby Marathon Course @Google",
      "alt": "Kentucky Derby Marathon Course"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>马拉松赛道穿过<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">路易斯维尔</strong>downtown的街道，经过许多志性的地标，包括老<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">路易斯维尔</strong>、<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">路易斯维尔</strong>大学，丘吉尔唐斯<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">赛马</strong>场。半马过后，还可以穿越俄亥俄河，来到印地安纳州，用另一种视角，完成全马的后半程。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "Derby Marathon Start @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Derby Marathon Start"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>比赛当天，稍微有点阴天，天气的温度刚刚好，可以穿着短袖直接开跑，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">47</span>半马，我全马，赛前还看到了Cindy，今天她要来做志愿者，给大家发奖牌。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "Derby Marathon Start @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Derby Marathon Start"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "Derby Marathon Start @Marathon",
      "alt": "Derby Marathon Start"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>终于要开跑了，我们从棒球场向西出发，第一个mile基本都在路城的downtown，这1 mile里最吸引人的是市区里的两个巨大的地标。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "Golden Statue of David @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Golden Statue of David"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>一个是金色大卫像，这是米开朗基罗的大卫雕像的一个30英尺（9.14米）高的金色复制品，位于21C酒店外（21c Museum Hotel），这座雕像是由土耳其艺术家塞尔坎·奥兹卡亚（Serkan Özkaya）创建的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "1 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "1 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "Run in Downtown @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Run in Downtown"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "Run in Downtown @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Run in Downtown"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-027.webp",
      "caption": "Run in Downtown @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Run in Downtown"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>另一个是<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">路易斯维尔</strong>棒球博物馆（<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">Louisville</strong> Slugger Museum）边的世界上最大的棒球棒，这个建于1995年的棒子是钢的，重达68,000磅（30,844千克）。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-028.webp",
      "caption": "Louisville Slugger Museum @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Louisville Slugger Museum"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-029.webp",
      "caption": "1.5 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "1.5 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>不到2 mile，我们就迎来了第一个补给点，接着，所有跑者会来一个大转弯，迎着日出向东边跑。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-030.webp",
      "caption": "2 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-031.webp",
      "caption": "2.5 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "2.5 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>眼前是教堂的塔尖，远处是城市的天际线和日出的光晕。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-032.webp",
      "caption": "3 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "3 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>3 mile过后，在broadway上的交通局（Transit Authority of River City）边会有一个很大的补给点，还会有摄影师给大家拍照，旁边的L&amp;N Building前，还会有很多小朋友和大家打招呼。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-033.webp",
      "caption": "Transit Authority of River City @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Transit Authority of River City"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-034.webp",
      "caption": "Go Baby Go! @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Go Baby Go!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>接着4 mile右转，我们会沿着4街，一路向南，直到丘吉尔<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">赛马</strong>场。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-035.webp",
      "caption": "4 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "4 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-036.webp",
      "caption": "Run in Downtown @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Run in Downtown"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这一路上，我们首先会经过好几个教堂，比如成立于1857年的Calvary Episcopal Church，成立于1815年的Walnut Street Baptist Church，建立于1888年的Fourth Avenue United Methodist Church.</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-037.webp",
      "caption": "Fourth Avenue United Methodist Church @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Fourth Avenue United Methodist Church"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我去过几次核桃街，里面很华丽，我还在里面参加了Ryan的婚礼，当时组织婚礼的老奶奶说，她的奶奶在这里结的婚，她的妈妈在这里结的婚，她也在这里结的婚，很棒的传承。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-038.webp",
      "caption": "Near 5 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Near 5 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>接着，我们会在5 mile的时候，绕到6街和5街中间的Central Park，夏天的时候，这里经常会有莎士比亚舞台剧的表演，还会有food truck，适合一家老小一起，享受周末傍晚的时光。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-039.webp",
      "caption": "Near Central Park @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Near Central Park"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>公园周边的Historic Old <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">Louisville</strong> Neighborhood是一个很漂亮的街区，每年都会举行St. James Court Art Show</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>St. James Court以其维多利亚时期的建筑和绿树成荫的街道而闻名。展览涵盖了各种各样的艺术品，包括绘画、雕塑、陶瓷、珠宝等。St. James Court Art Show是全美国最古老，最负盛名的艺术展之一，每年吸引很多艺术家和游客。通常在十月初举行，吸引来自美国各地的艺术家和游客参与。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>接着在6 mile的时候我们经过了我之前在”老<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">路易斯维尔</strong>“租的房子附近，虽然房子很旧，但是住的还挺舒服。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>其实这一片区域都叫 Old <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">Louisville</strong>，它是美国第三大历史保护区，它拥有全美国最大的修复维多利亚式住宅。该社区由40多个街区的维多利亚时代住宅组成。听说房屋外表是不可以随意修改颜色的，大概也是为了保护历史遗迹。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-040.webp",
      "caption": "UofL @Arsenan",
      "alt": "UofL"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-041.webp",
      "caption": "UofL @Arsenan",
      "alt": "UofL"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>接着，我们横穿<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">路易斯维尔</strong>大学主校区，左手边的食堂Vill Grill， 右手边的健身房SRC，一切都是那么的熟悉。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-042.webp",
      "caption": "Fire Station @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Fire Station"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>然后，我们在7 mile右转， 丘吉尔唐斯<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">赛马</strong>场（<strong><strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">Churchill</strong> Downs</strong>）就在不远处，我们朝着双尖塔的方向跑去，然后大家就像矫健的骑手一样，一头扎进这座拥有150年历史的充满荣耀的<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">赛马</strong>场。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-043.webp",
      "caption": "Run to Churchill Downs @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Run to Churchill Downs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-044.webp",
      "caption": "Run to Churchill Downs @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Run to Churchill Downs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-045.webp",
      "caption": "Run into Churchill Downs @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Run into Churchill Downs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑者们不会直接跑在<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">赛马</strong>的赛道上，而是穿过<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">赛马</strong>场，在8.5 mile的时候离开，穿过幽暗的通道，外面是欢呼的人群。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-046.webp",
      "caption": "Run at Churchill Downs @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Run at Churchill Downs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-047.webp",
      "caption": "Run at Churchill Downs @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Run at Churchill Downs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-048.webp",
      "caption": "Run at Churchill Downs @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Run at Churchill Downs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-049.webp",
      "caption": "8 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "8 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-050.webp",
      "caption": "Run out Churchill Downs @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Run out Churchill Downs"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>接下来，跑步路线会沿着三街折返，大家沿着笔直的路线穿过<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">路易斯维尔</strong>校园，中间还能看到我的办公室，以及学校的图书馆，这边会有欢呼的人群和学生。还有接力队伍的交接点，显得很热闹。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-051.webp",
      "caption": "Back to School @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Back to School"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-052.webp",
      "caption": "Back to School @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Back to School"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-053.webp",
      "caption": "Back to School @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Back to School"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-054.webp",
      "caption": "9 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "9 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>出了校园，比赛路线再次回到老<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">路易斯维尔</strong>（Old <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">Louisville</strong>），并且一路延伸到Downtown的12 mile 处，才开始向西蔓延。我也在11 mile附近停下来，吃了一些补给。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-055.webp",
      "caption": "Old Louisville @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Old Louisville"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-056.webp",
      "caption": "11 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "11 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在12 mile之前，我们会路过肯德基Yum!中心（KFC Yum! Center），这是一个NBA级别的体育馆，这个体育馆在2010年开放，建设成本为2.38亿美元，现在是<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">路易斯维尔</strong>篮球队的NCAA主场，NBA球星多诺万·米切尔（Donovan Mitchell）应该也在这里代表路大打过球。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-057.webp",
      "caption": "KFC Yum! Center @Arsenan",
      "alt": "KFC Yum! Center"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这里也吸引了许多其他活动，并在《Pollstar Magazine》的音乐会和演出门票销售榜上排名第50。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-058.webp",
      "caption": "Back to Downtown @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Back to Downtown"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-059.webp",
      "caption": "12 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "12 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>接着，半马选手要返回终点了，而我们全马跑者会在13 mile之后，爬上大四桥（<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">Big Four Bridge</strong>），并沿着一路的俄亥俄河风光跑向印第安纳州的杰斐逊维尔（Jeffersonville）</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-060.webp",
      "caption": "Marathon or Mini @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Marathon or Mini"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-061.webp",
      "caption": "13 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "13 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>这座桥建于1929年，是一座六跨度的铁路桁架桥，这里也是我在路城最喜欢的地点之一，非常适合散步或看风景。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-062.webp",
      "caption": "Big Four Bridge @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Big Four Bridge"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-063.webp",
      "caption": "Ohio View @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Ohio View"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-064.webp",
      "caption": "14 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "14 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>来到印第安纳州，我们会沿着俄亥俄河向西北方向跑去，换一个角度看路城，会有一些不一样的感受。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-065.webp",
      "caption": "Big Four Bridge on Indy Side @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Big Four Bridge on Indy Side"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>特别是横跨在俄亥俄河上的几座桥，显得特别壮丽。如果说前半程，给我感受最深的是路城的城市文化和积淀，后半程更多的是自然风光和一波一波的跑步朋友。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-066.webp",
      "caption": "Jeffersonville @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Jeffersonville"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-067.webp",
      "caption": "15 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "15 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-068.webp",
      "caption": "George Rogers Clark Memorial Bridge @Arsenan",
      "alt": "George Rogers Clark Memorial Bridge"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>16 mile左右，我们会跑上Clarksville的绿堤，两边郁郁葱葱，跑起来很舒服，有种跑汉马后半程东湖绿道的感觉。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-069.webp",
      "caption": "16 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "16 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在这边，我见到了我们跑步社区的超级大神Manivannan Vangalur，他在这边给大家发补给和加油，我分别在16 mile， 19 mile 和24 mile遇到他，每次都会得到巨大的鼓励。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-070.webp",
      "caption": "Mani @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Mani"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在16 mile之后， Tavi的4：30小组追上了我，我也跟了一段时间，直到20 mile战略性放弃。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-071.webp",
      "caption": "Tavi 430 Pacer @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Tavi 430 Pacer"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-072.webp",
      "caption": "19 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "19 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-073.webp",
      "caption": "Mani ×2 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Mani ×2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>然后一抬头，我的印度朋友Raj正好迎面过来，他应该还会有一段距离才会折返。我们击了一下拳，抓紧赶路。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-074.webp",
      "caption": "20 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "20 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-075.webp",
      "caption": "Raj @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Raj"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>回程的路上，我又和5：00的兔子Glenn打了个招呼，又在22.5 mile的时候来到了Patrick的补给点，狠狠地补了一些能量。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-076.webp",
      "caption": "Glenn @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Glenn"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-077.webp",
      "caption": "22 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "22 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-078.webp",
      "caption": "Patrick @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Patrick"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>23 mile前有一个\"Rosie the Riveter\"互动纪念碑，前面写着：\"We Can Do It!\"，\"Rosie the Riveter\"是一个文化象征，代表在二战期间在工厂和船厂工作的妇女。也象征着美国妇女的集体赋权和妇女在职场独立的象征。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-079.webp",
      "caption": "Rosie the Riveter @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Rosie the Riveter"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>接在24 mile，Mani给了我一些软糖补充糖分，我有点惊讶，他是怎么瞬移过来的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-080.webp",
      "caption": "Mani ×3 @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Mani ×3"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-081.webp",
      "caption": "24 mile @Arsenan",
      "alt": "24 mile"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-082.webp",
      "caption": "Back to KY @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Back to KY"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-083.webp",
      "caption": "Back to KY @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Back to KY"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-084.webp",
      "caption": "Back to KY @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Back to KY"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跨过大四桥，我终于又回到了<strong>肯塔基</strong>!</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-085.webp",
      "caption": "Almost Done @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Almost Done"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-086.webp",
      "caption": "Almost Done @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Almost Done"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-087.webp",
      "caption": "Almost Done @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Almost Done"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>身体状态还很OK，我一路小跑，冲过<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">终点线</span>，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">4小时</span>40多分钟，还行。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-088.webp",
      "caption": "Done @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Done"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-089.webp",
      "caption": "Finish @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Finish"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-090.webp",
      "caption": "Medal Time @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Medal Time"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>赛后Party在Racing <strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">Louisville</strong>的主场，小蘑菇在做志愿者，Cindy已经回家了，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">47</span>也早就完赛了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我和<span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">47</span>，小蘑菇一起来了张合影，正好这时看到一个穿着阿森纳衣服的跑者刚刚完赛，我赶紧又和他申请了一张阿森纳战友的照片。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-091.webp",
      "caption": "Arsenan, Siqi and Xiaomogu @Siqi",
      "alt": "Arsenan, Siqi and Xiaomogu"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-092.webp",
      "caption": "Arsenan and Siqi @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Arsenan and Siqi"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-093.webp",
      "caption": "Arsenaal Team @MaraFoto",
      "alt": "Arsenaal Team"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>赛后的Party还挺热闹，我们还看到了Jim和Christine，简单聊了几句，接着我又给奖牌拍了一堆照片，有点意犹未尽的回家。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-094.webp",
      "caption": "26.2 @Siqi",
      "alt": "26.2"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-095.webp",
      "caption": "Jim and Christine @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Jim and Christine"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-096.webp",
      "caption": "Medal @Arsenan",
      "alt": "Medal"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>赛后发现官方照片还不少，我也选择了一些放到了这个文里。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2023-clean_files/img-097.webp",
      "caption": "2023 Derby Marathon · 赛事官方 Tool",
      "alt": "2023 Derby Marathon"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "后记"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我想没有比一场马拉松更好的方式来认识这座城市了，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">四年</span>时间，一晃就过去了，如果不写这个文，我想我是没有机会去细究”这个建筑是啥”，“那条街是什么名字”的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>花了点时间来整理文字和照片，今年做事更加有条理，也不想做年更男了，趁着芝加哥误机，完成了这个文的大部分。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最后说一下，我是真的喜欢Stephanie Fish组织的<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">Derby</strong>马拉松的训练营，每次训练之后的巧克力汁总会让我觉得是这世界上最棒的饮料，但每次自己买，就会觉得一点也不好喝。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Patrick Messenger每周二的Track训练，也总会让我学到不一样的技巧和训练方法；还有Fleet Feet的朋友们，Myrdin Thompson真的是一个非常nice的组织者。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>我喜欢我们这样的跑步社区，所以我也总会拉着我的朋友们去跑步，我很高兴我的土耳其朋友Fatih Usta在回到伊斯坦布尔之后参加了好多小跑步比赛，也收集了一些奖牌。他说是我和<span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">47</span>在<strong data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">Louisville</strong>的时候给了他 Motivation，我们也约好有一天一起去跑伊斯坦布尔马拉松。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>还有我的孟加拉朋友Sumit Paul，去年我们跑Ice Cream 5k的时候，他还气喘吁吁的倒数前几，这一年我总叫他去上单车课，进步巨大，一路领头。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>还有Ryan，新晋路城跑马小能手，每每刷新Joe Creason Parkrun 5k的PR，也即将迎来了他的第一个全马。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p><span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">47</span>就不用说了，Marathoner!</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>就像“没病，谁听二手玫瑰啊？脑袋没点问题，谁跑马拉松啊？” 我承认，跑马对大多数人来说显得过于极限了，但也许你的膝盖比你想象中的强。</p>"
    }
  ]
}